From 4cc9293910aa8cad54f4383e3d3e472c503263ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:14:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Display settings as modal dialog, leaner hero markup, mega
 menus without completed projects, JSON-LD graph with events, rendering tweaks

- A11yPanel: native <dialog> at the end of <body> (h1 is the first heading), showModal with focus return, backdrop click, full height on phones; --font-scale variable
- Hero: only the first photo in the HTML (preloaded with imagesrcset), the other 10 in a <template>, captions as data attributes (no empty list, no img without src)
- Logo link named by the image alt text
- Mega menus list current projects only, plus one archive link; duplicate "All programmes" link removed
- All projects page: current projects by programme, then #archiv/#archive/#archives with completed projects
- Schema.org @graph: NGO (@id, slogan, both addresses), WebSite, Event nodes from event files (home, events, event pages)
- content-visibility on lower homepage sections, layout/style containment on quick links, icon shape-rendering

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D2JeGqUFJDvaNQJD3KYYr6
